<title>USA: Biopsys Q1 Dec 31 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Biopsys Q1 Dec 31 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>BIOPSYS MEDICAL INC</p>
<p>			    3 Mos ended 12/31    6 Mos ended 12/31</p>
<p>			    1996	 1995	1996	   1995</p>
<p>Net sales	  $ 3,302,000  $ 538,000 $5,703,000  $  763,000</p>
<p>Cost of sales	1,404,000    317,000  2,510,000     470,000</p>
