<p>Net EPS (1)	 $     0.01  $   (0.12)  $   0.00 $    (0.20)</p>
<p>Wgtd avg shrs (1) 11,055,000  7,600,000  10,983,000  7,570,000</p>
<p>NOTE: (1) Net loss per share and weighted average shares outstanding for the three and six months ended Dec. 31, 1995 are computed on a pro forma basis assuming conversion of the then-outstanding preferred stock.</p>
